AccountAge-accountage = { $mention } created the account on { $date } ({ $delta } ago)
AccountAge-deco_helper = Check the Twitch account creation date.
AccountAge-deco_usage = Usage: { $prefix }accountage (username)
AccountAge-deco_description = Returns the creation date of a Twitch account and how long ago it was created. If no username is given, it checks your own account.

# Commands
AccountAge-cmd_ex1_args = accountage mr_chuw
AccountAge-cmd_ex1_res = @mr_chuw created the account on 20/01/2019 19:34:45 (6 year ago).

AccountAge-cmd_ex2_args = accountage
AccountAge-cmd_ex2_res = @your_name created the account on 20/01/2019 19:34:45 (6 year ago).
